+        "| composition | color | p10 | p25 | p50 | p75 | p90 | mean | stdev | bust rate | hero err | opp err | p99 ms |",
+        "| --- | --- | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: |",
+    ]
